  '/templates/wall-feature-strip-tiling': `<h1>Wall Feature Strip Tiling Template</h1><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; <a href="/templates">Templates</a> &rsaquo; Wall Feature Strip Tiling</nav><p>Decorative wall strip: 4m wide x 1m high, 100x200mm mosaic tiles, adhesive method. This template loads the <a href="/tile-calculator">Tile Calculator</a> for a decorative wall feature strip.</p><h2>What This Template Includes</h2><ul><li>Wall dimensions: 4m wide x 1m high</li><li>Tile size: 100x200mm mosaic</li><li>Installation method: adhesive</li><li>Standard waste factor</li></ul><h2>Related Templates</h2><ul><li><a href="/templates/kitchen-backsplash-tiling">Kitchen Backsplash Tiling</a></li><li><a href="/templates/guest-toilet-wall-tiling">Guest Toilet Wall Tiling</a></li></ul><p><a href="/tile-calculator">Open the Tile Calculator directly</a></p>`,

